        31,
        124
      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " containing a `fmt::Arguments`. In std, however, panicking can be done with panic_any, which",
      "path": "doc",
      "range": [
        125,
        220
      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " throws a `Box<dyn Any>` containing any type of value. Because of this,",
      "path": "doc",
