      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " `std::panic::PanicHookInfo` is a different type, which contains a `&dyn Any` instead of a",
      "path": "doc",
      "range": [
        296,
        389
      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " `fmt::Arguments`. std's panic handler will convert the `fmt::Arguments` to a `&dyn Any`",
      "path": "doc",
      "range": [
        390,
        481
      ],
      "style": "inner"
    },
    {
      "doc_text": " containing either a `&'static str` or `String` containing the formatted message.",
      "path": "doc",
